meta {
  name: 10 quoting something to be exact
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/_nl
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "prompt": "how many 'Red Running Shoe' are there in stock"
  }
}

docs {
  What you get back - quoting something to be exact

  Text in quotes is taken literally: the same capitals, the same spacing, the same words. Use it when you want one specific thing rather than whatever the words happen to match.
}
